  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T04:47:05.124714Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T04:47:05.124714Z",
  "totalBlocks": 55,
  "translatedBlocks": 55,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eccd0893770ca0fd",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们来看看打造 GitHub CoPilot 背后的技术需要什么——那是一个在程序员写代码时提供建议的应用。在这份分步指南中，我们将学习如何完全从零训练一个叫 CodeParrot 🦜 的大型 GPT-2 模型。CodeParrot 能自动补全你的 Python 代码——点这里试试。让我们开始从零构建吧！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "28bce5081c4dfcdd",
      "translationZh": "构建大型源代码数据集",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f92582abf05783ee",
      "translationZh": "首先我们需要一个大型训练数据集。目标是训练一个 Python 代码生成模型，所以我们访问了 Google BigQuery 上的 GitHub 转储，筛出所有 Python 文件，得到一个 180 GB、2000 万文件的数据集（见这里）。最初的训练实验之后，我们发现数据集中的重复严重影响了模型性能。深入调查后发现：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb5d2048403b51ae",
      "translationZh": "0.1% 的唯一文件占了全部文件的 15%",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e55bc5fbaa2af71d",
      "translationZh": "1% 的唯一文件占了全部文件的 35%",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "319277b6f7d87c7a",
      "translationZh": "10% 的唯一文件占了全部文件的 66%",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11d10204ae4dae0c",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这一 Twitter 讨论串中进一步了解我们的发现。我们剔除了重复项，并应用了 Codex 论文中相同的清洗启发式。Codex 是 CoPilot 背后的模型，是在 GitHub 代码上微调的 GPT-3。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "320fbfe01b8019ce",
      "translationZh": "清洗后的数据集仍有 50GB，已发布在 Hugging Face Hub：codeparrot-clean。有了它，我们就可以配置新的分词器并训练模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "524b034b525869b6",
      "translationZh": "初始化分词器与模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afc684c43861c3b8",
      "translationZh": "首先需要一个分词器。我们专门在代码上训练一个，让它能很好地切分代码 token。我们可以拿一个现有分词器（如 GPT-2 的），用 train_new_from_iterator() 方法直接在自己的数据集上训练，然后推送到 Hub。注意，为了保持代码块紧凑，示例中省略了 import、参数解析和日志；包含预处理与下游任务评估的完整代码见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f752d67d32d8652",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face 课程中可以了解更多关于分词器及其构建方式的知识。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23213ebde41e1545",
      "translationZh": "看到那个不起眼的 streaming=True 参数了吗？这个小改动影响巨大：它不再下载完整（50GB）数据集，而是按需流式传输单个样本，节省大量磁盘空间！关于流式的更多信息见 Hugging Face 课程。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c5c834821f961a3",
      "translationZh": "现在初始化新模型。我们沿用 GPT-2 large（15 亿参数）的超参数，调整嵌入层以适配新分词器，并加入一些稳定性调整。scale_attn_by_layer_idx 标志确保按层 id 缩放注意力，reorder_and_upcast_attn 主要确保以全精度计算注意力以避免数值问题。我们把新初始化的模型推送到与分词器相同的仓库。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c55659749f3ff38",
      "translationZh": "有了高效的分词器和全新初始化的模型，就可以开始真正的训练循环了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "706e1d632ef0f12b",
      "translationZh": "实现训练循环",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2f7a50d15746dc3",
      "translationZh": "我们用 🤗 Accelerate 库训练，它让我们无需改动一行代码，就能把训练从笔记本扩展到多 GPU 机器。我们只需创建一个 accelerator 并做些参数整理：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cbe611b18c64155",
      "translationZh": "现在可以开训了！用 huggingface_hub 客户端库克隆包含新分词器和模型的仓库，并为本次实验 checkout 一个新分支。这样就能并行跑很多实验，最后把最好的那个合并进主分支。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "298358612dc2b303",
      "translationZh": "分词器和模型可以直接从本地仓库加载。由于模型很大，我们可能要打开梯度检查点（gradient checkpointing）来降低训练时的显存占用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2004601869dcb39c",
      "translationZh": "接下来是数据集。我们让数据集产出固定上下文长度的样本，让训练更简单。为了不浪费太多数据（有些样本过短或过长），可以把许多样本用 EOS token 拼接起来再切块。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c900811c211c6597",
      "translationZh": "一次一起准备的序列越多，被丢弃的 token 比例（上图的灰色部分）越小。因为我们想流式处理数据集而非提前备好一切，所以用 IterableDataset。完整的数据集类如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecb33741b6508d54",
      "translationZh": "缓冲区中的文本被并行分词后拼接，然后不断产出切块样本，直到缓冲区清空再重新开始。若设 infinite=True，数据集迭代器会在结尾处重新开始。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "814d5968fcb1ac6c",
      "translationZh": "开始训练前还要设置优化器和学习率调度。我们不想对偏置和 LayerNorm 权重施加权重衰减，所以用一个辅助函数把它们排除掉。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9efeeb53ab22e294",
      "translationZh": "还有一个大问题：所有数据和模型如何分发到多块 GPU？听起来复杂，但实际上用 🤗 Accelerate 只需一行代码。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55b42ff1465a1231",
      "translationZh": "它在底层使用 DistributedDataParallel：每个 GPU worker 收到一个批次，各自持有模型副本，在本地计算梯度后聚合，用来更新每个 worker 上的模型。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d4acc0c14e1aa07",
      "translationZh": "我们还想时不时在验证集上评估模型，那就写一个函数来做这件事。它会自动以分布式方式执行，我们只需从各 worker 汇总损失，同时报告困惑度（perplexity）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff651cceb78400d9",
      "translationZh": "现在可以写主训练循环了。它看起来与普通的 PyTorch 训练循环非常相像，只是随处可见我们用 accelerator 函数替代了原生 PyTorch。此外，每次评估后我们都把模型推送到分支。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb864adb1fc6f2c9",
      "translationZh": "调用 wait_for_everyone() 和 unwrap_model() 时，我们确保所有 worker 都已就绪，并移除此前 prepare() 添加的模型层。我们还使用了容易实现的梯度累积与梯度裁剪。最后，训练完成后跑一次最终评估，保存最终模型并推送到 hub。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f09d51d7839c46a3",
      "translationZh": "完成！从零训练完整 GPT-2 模型所需的全部代码不过 150 行左右。为了让代码更紧凑，我们没有展示脚本的 import 和日志。现在真的开始训练吧！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a3cb6a4f8458f93",
      "translationZh": "用这段代码，我们为即将出版的 Transformers 与 NLP 书籍训练了两个模型：1.1 亿和 15 亿参数的 GPT-2。我们用一台 16 x A100 GPU 的机器分别训练了 1 天和 1 周——足够喝杯咖啡、读上一两本书了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "163e44b102626149",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "334d8ef78120a1e7",
      "translationZh": "对预训练来说这仍是相对较短的训练，但与同类模型相比已经能看到不错的下游性能。我们在 OpenAI 的 HumanEval 基准（出自 Codex 论文）上评估了模型，它衡量代码生成模型在近 200 道编程挑战上的表现。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07213543937bfcc7",
      "translationZh": "注意，CodeParrot 只用了约 250-300 亿 token 训练，而 GPT-neo 用了 3000 亿 token，Codex 用了 3000 亿（GPT-3 检查点）+ 1000 亿（代码）token。所以这里的性价比相当高。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbce7afdf98a56b7",
      "translationZh": "那么 pass@k 指标到底是什么？简单说，它衡量的是：给定模型的 k 个候选生成，至少一个程序通过该编程问题单元测试的概率。自然，k 越大该指标越高，因为更多候选更有可能解出编程挑战。你可以通过 datasets 使用该指标：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eef33b08a0d2d820",
      "translationZh": "你也可以用 datasets 加载 OpenAI 的 HumanEval 数据集：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10a01587d5113b55",
      "translationZh": "现在，焦急等待之后，让我们看看得到了什么！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d97bb8c6cc8b6d5e",
      "translationZh": "先来点简单的：看看能否提示模型写一个函数，根据路径返回文件大小：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35261535449d29f8",
      "translationZh": "提示：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819c15f77c3040af",
      "translationZh": "补全：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99fbc2253f18cb7a",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止一切顺利，再进一步，试些更有意思的：构建生产可用代码时最无趣的环节之一就是写单元测试。看看能不能让 CodeParrot 替我们做这件事！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35261535449d29f8",
      "translationZh": "提示：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819c15f77c3040af",
      "translationZh": "补全：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e6266152a0f1da1",
      "translationZh": "虽然测试条件本身看起来不太对，但模型已经为我们搭好了全部样板代码。光这一点就相当有用，能省下几分钟时间！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6aca96fc8005f38",
      "translationZh": "但我们真正想做的是构建更好的 transformer 模型。让 CodeParrot 来帮忙：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35261535449d29f8",
      "translationZh": "提示：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "819c15f77c3040af",
      "translationZh": "补全：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6096decbc4633f14",
      "translationZh": "看几个示例不错，但你现在大概想亲自试试了。我们专门准备了几个在线演示！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f61ec10d1385dcc0",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f88947f1ac0edf3",
      "translationZh": "你可以在我们加到 Hugging Face Spaces 的两个演示里把玩这些模型：第一个用模型快速生成代码，第二个用模型高亮你的代码以发现 bug！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6dd237e349c99620",
      "translationZh": "代码生成",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ca448ed734b81d4",
      "translationZh": "代码高亮",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2dc4c73950e2d0c3",
      "translationZh": "你也可以直接在 transformers 库中使用这些模型：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e76a94ac8320d51",
      "translationZh": "总结",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82759f0cc0eb13b2",
      "translationZh": "在这篇短博文中，我们走完了训练一个名为 CodeParrot 🦜 的大型 GPT-2 代码生成模型的全部步骤。借助 🤗 Accelerate，我们用不到 200 行代码构建了能轻松扩展到多 GPU 的训练脚本。现在轮到你训练自己的 GPT-2 模型了！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1a8c26829ef3a19",
      "translationZh": "本文对 CodeParrot 🦜 做了简要介绍。如果你有兴趣深入了解如何预训练这类模型，我们推荐阅读即将出版的 Transformers 与 NLP 书籍中专门讲它的章节：那里围绕构建自定义数据集、训练新分词器的设计考量以及架构选择提供了更多细节。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "gradient checkpointing",
      "briefZh": "梯度检查点",
      "explanationZh": "以重算换显存的训练省存技术"
    },
    {
      "term": "IterableDataset",
      "briefZh": "可迭代数据集",
      "explanationZh": "流式产出样本、无需全部下载的数据集类型"
    },
    {
